    "detailed_description": "Platform Game Maker is exciting tool to make your dream Platform Game!<br />\r\nYou can choose from many many pre-made blocks, sprites and other 2D assets and place them in your levels, and then add several different type of monsters to play and test your own levels.<br />\r\nChoose different backgrounds and ornamental sprites to populate and visually enhance your levels.<br />\r\nThere are several main characters to choose from, each can be the hero of your levels<br />\r\nYou can also add many health pick-ups, different obstacles as well.<br />\r\nPlace check-points if your levels are too difficult to complete in one run.<br />\r\nDon\u2019t forget to put your end-level award at the end of your levels!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures :<br />\r\n* Tons of pre-made blocks to choose from while making your platformer levels.<br />\r\n*Several different enemies to put inside your level, each with different AI logic<br />\r\n*Ability to change backgrounds.",
